description:
World Wars Tanks is a free online tactical tank arcade game dedicated to the major battles of World War II. Kpfw. IV; and the American M Sherman, M, M Lee, and others.
Choose one of four main factions:
USSR – durable and widely produced tanks with excellent cross-country ability;
Germany – powerful armor and highly accurate guns;
USA – balanced vehicles with good mobility and reliability.
UK – heavy armor and powerful guns.
